[ti:Shakti jaag ri]
[ar:VESAHE · hkfaduio]
[al:Sanatan & Devotional]
[by:Radio Vaigyaaniq — draft timing, unverified]
[00:08.00]Shakti jaag ri…
[00:13.29]Shakti jaag ri…
[00:18.58]Antar jyoti prajwalit ho ri…
[00:23.86]Man soya tan khoya,
[00:29.15]Shwaason mein uljha jag saara,
[00:34.44]Naam tera jab goonje bheetar,
[00:39.73]Jaage chetan deep hamaara…
[00:45.01]Jaag re maanav pehchaan tu,
[00:50.30]Kan-kan mein brahm samaaya,
[00:55.59]Tu hi prashna tu hi uttar,
[01:00.88]Tu hi jyoti tu hi chaaya…
[01:06.17]Lam… Lam… prithvi ka kampan…
[01:11.45]Vam… Vam… ras ki dhaara…
[01:16.74]Ram… Ram… agni prajwalit…
[01:22.03]Yam… Yam… hriday vistaar…
[01:27.32]Ham… Ham… shabd shuddh ho…
[01:32.60]Om… Om… bindu prakaa▮▮▮…
[01:37.89]Shakti jaag ri!
[01:43.18]Maanav jaag ri!
[01:48.47]Antar brahm pehchaan ri!
[01:53.75]Agyan ka tam tootey aaj,
[01:59.04]Gyaan ki jwaala prakat ho aaj,
[02:04.33]Tu hi srishti tu hi karta,
[02:09.62]Tu hi ant aur tu hi aarambh aaj!
[02:14.91]Shakti jaag ri… jaag ri… jaag ri…
[02:20.19]Antar shoonya mein poorn samaaya…
[02:25.48]Shwaas mein shaanti, naad mein shoonya,
[02:30.77]Man hua ab nirmal poorn,
[02:36.06]Shakti jaag ri…
[02:41.34]Shakti sthir ho ri…
[02:46.63]Chetna poorn ho ri…
